# D: benchmark
# PHP 8.6.0RC2, clamp(): native
# opcache: on, JIT: on

## 5,000,000 calls each, best of 9 rounds
                             total ms   ns/call    net ns
loop only, no clamping            8.5       1.7         -
clamp()                          57.5      11.5       9.8
inline max(min())                32.7       6.5       4.8
inline ternary                   13.6       2.7       1.0
helper function (ternary)        45.5       9.1       7.4
helper function (min/max)        49.6       9.9       8.2

every clamping variant returned the same sum: true
